+# Production Readiness Checklist (what must pass before calling Aegis "production")
+
+1) Hardware proofs (per-target)
+ - p99 loop jitter and safe-stop SLOs measured and passing for each representative ECU/controller/bus topology (CAN, CAN-FD, TSN).
+ - Signed evidence bundle for each proof present in S3.
+
+2) Controller certification
+ - HIL campaigns executed for all critical controllers; waveform compare results within thresholds.
+ - All Apalache counterexamples resolved or documented as accepted mitigations.
+ - Signed HIL certification bundle submitted to certifier and response tracked.
+
+3) Perception validation
+ - Large-scale sim -> HIL -> field campaigns executed.
+ - Adversarial/OOD failures collected, retrained/hardened models exported to ONNX and smoke-tested on NPU runners.
+ - False negative / OOD metrics within acceptance thresholds.
+
+4) Provenance & CI
+ - Builder hardening validated and builders produce cosign-signed images with Rekor entries.
+ - CI promotion gates (enforce_builder_provenance.py) block unsigned/unanotated images.
+
+5) Carbon & governance
+ - Carbon monitor run for observation window; tuned thresholds committed to CI.
+ - Override process documented and tested (override_signer.py) and audit logs retained.
+
+6) Evidence & retention
+ - All evidence manifests recorded via ops.sdk.evidence_sdk.record_manifest
+ - Evidence stored in S3 per ops/governance/evidence_retention_policy.md
